{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e88c2422-b946-87be-95ed-a4b5f022313e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:31:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. City Hall is closed today, so you've reached the after-hours line. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. I know the City Hall is closed, it is Sunday, so I call this number on the storm. My name is Theresa Santoro. Can you hear me okay? I am on the speakerphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:28:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, Theresa. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I am the landlord for a house at 294 Pelham Street, in the Historic Hill. After the nor'easter that ended yesterday, the driveway, at the apron, where it meets the street, it holds a puddle. And the water, it runs toward the garage door. [pause] I am worried it goes under."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so at 294 Pelham, the apron at the end of the driveway is holding water and it's pitched toward the garage. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. Everything came down from the street. You cannot walk without you slide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:29:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mud and grit across the sidewalk. Is there a storm drain close by, do you know, that looks clogged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a drain by the curb, a little down from my house. It is full of leaves and the sand, I think. [line breaks up] I cannot see the water go in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:29:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up for a second. You said the drain by the curb is full of leaves and sand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:29:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Leaves and sand. So I want to ask you, when did they last come by here? To clean, to sweep. I do not remember to see the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning log in front of me on this line, so I can't tell you the last date for Pelham. I'll put in a request for the crew to look at the drain and the sidewalk, and the office can tell you the history on Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:29:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is good. Please, I give you my number. It is 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189. Got it. And the name is Santoro, S-A-N-T-O-R-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Wait, one moment, I write it. I use a paper address book, I do not trust the phones, they eat everything. So I put your name here. Lorraine, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lorraine, that's right. Medeiros. I'll note on the request that the water is running toward the garage door, so they know it's a priority for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you. And if it rains again before they come, what do I do? I do not want the water in the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's coming in or it's getting worse, call this line back and tell them it's active. In the meantime, if you can safely clear the leaves off the top of the drain, that can help it take water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can do this with a rake. I try. Thank you for your time, Lorraine, on a Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Theresa. The request is in. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T15:31:01-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
